note.p:
Participants listed below not previously identified are John D. Jernegan,
                    Assistant Secretary of State for Near Eastern, South Asian and African Affairs;
                    James C. H. Bonbright, Deputy Assistant Secretary of State for European Affairs;
                    James W. Riddleberger, Director of the Bureau of German Affairs; Douglas
                    MacArthur II, assigned to the Bureau of European Affairs. On Mar. 30, MacArthur
                    became Counselor of the Department.
